                <pb facs="0177" n="59" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg59"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adams to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1889</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Revolution by army and navy yesterday. Ministry deposed. Prime minister
                    imprisoned. Minister marine wounded. Emperor prisoner in palace. Provisional
                    government issued proclamation. Imperial dynasty deposed. Council state
                    abolished. Parliament dissolved. Republic declared. Principal provinces
                    acquiesce. Order maintained. Opinion republic successful. Await
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adams</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
